    categories: {
      guide: "Hex Guide",
      description: "This section was written by my hand — of that I am certain — and yet whether it truly comes from my hand is another matter. I remember leaving my mark in this notebook word by word, and still I cannot help but wonder for whom these sections were written. What reader was I hoping for back then? It is a question worth pondering — one that is sometimes even frightening.$(br2)$(o)\"All that I know, I speak freely.\"$()",
    },

    demo: {
